      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-05-29_WidnesExaminer_art0028" n="art0028">
        <head>liis Blood to Blame, -- Blood-Poisoninz, from a trivial wound.</head>
        <p>liis Blood to Blame, -- Blood-Poisoninz, from a trivial wound.</p>
        <p>Cured by the New, Good Blood supplied</p>
        <p>by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills</p>
