      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-05-29_WidnesExaminer_art0042" n="art0042">
        <head>Domestic Servants, etc.</head>
        <p>Domestic Servants, etc.</p>
        <p>WTANTED, young GENERAL; about 16.—Apply 47, MELLING RD., Southport.</p>
        <p>WANTED COOK-GENERAL young. Protestant. INGLEFIURST. Kirby. near Liverpool.</p>
        <p>wrANTED. GIRL, 16 to 18; General Help.—Woon 6, Hall at., Church lane, Moston, Manchester.</p>
        <p>WvANTED Good GENERALS at once.—Apply,-with references, ROTHWELL S SELECT REGISTRY, Heywood.</p>
        <p>• WANTED Good GENERAL SERVANT; refer- ences required; private house.-35, GLES ELDON- RD., St. Anne's-on-Sea.</p>
        <p>_ WANTED GENERAL SERVANT; experienced; state wages and give references.—Mrs. MILLER, 2, Palmyra square, Warrington.</p>
        <p>-7 - • • ysTANTED COOK-GENERAL, family two; house- maid-waitress kept.—Address Mrs. ROGERSON, Bungalow, St. Acmes-on-Sea.</p>
        <p>WANTED, good GENERAL SERVANT • three in family.—Apply Mrs. BRADLEY, HazdMount, Padiham rd., Burnley.</p>
        <p>WANTED, GIRL (14-16), as Mother's Help ; as one of family ; good home; one child (12).—DAviEs, 360. Belmont rd., Bolton.</p>
        <p>WANTED GENERAL, plain cooking, housemaid kept.—Apply, Mrs. ALLEN, Ravenswood, Quarry Drive, Aughton, Ormskirk.</p>
        <p>WANTED, HOUSEMAID-WAITRESS ; state age experience, wages, and references.—Mrs. WHIT- FIELD, " Northolme," Chorley.</p>
        <p>WANTED, experienced HOUSEMAID-WAITttESS; small family; £l6-218 ; good references.— EASTON. East View, Blundellsands.</p>
        <p>WANTED, good GENERAL at once, references required.—Apply, Mrs. BROWN, Field House, Wilpsbire, near Blackburn, Lancashire.</p>
        <p>WANTED GENERAL, experienced ; good refer- ences; age 28-30;. competent woman; good wages-32, IRToN RD., Southport.</p>
