        <p>tERLIN'S CIVIC CHIEF. DR. KIRSCHNER, K.C.V.O. irty-five members of the Berlin Munic- Y are at present on a visit to this country. iI,"Y are headed bf Dr. Kirschner, K.C.V.0., a'be chief Burgomaster, whose portrait is given th"e• Dr. Kirschner is very popular with the citizens cf Berlin, who look up to him as b e model of what a chief Burgomaster should 4. In addition to receiving the hospitality ho!-ondon our German visitors have been tht re noud by being received by His Majesty Xing.</p>
