        <p>O'he %‘4,,a helti6litof the series of five monthly competitions u, the Range last, Saturday. The weather was *Ore wifttlY fine and there was a large attendance. kre h °4l entries for the competitions all of ItioN:er,p fired at 100 yards range under Bisley con- he following scores were made :- I,4Ssii,n. Bronze Badge Class (Service Rifle). 4 11°t8 ; 3in. bull's eye; seven shots, disappear- ?: Possible 56. Howard Dou,n 39 Vomit. Club Medal C 1553 (Miniature Rifle). • as as last,. Possible 56. C4,llT•bi 11aduerton 5l to•et Howard 49 ' 48 D. Gardiner 47</p>
