        <p>Those who are suffering from a any lo7m of Catarrh of the nose or throat .should investigate- the simple home treatment advised by Mr. Munyou,. the medical philanthropist. Full partieuhirs,. with a special offer of trial treatment and a, Manual of Home Remedies, will be sent post frl: to anyone mentioning the "Warrington Examineby r AtunYon, 61, New Ozford-street, Loudon, W.Q.-</p>
